  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 1408.01 Administrative Procedures Act.\n\n(a) In responding to any petition for rule making or declaratory ruling, and when proceeding in any contested case under RSA 356-B, the bureau shall comply with and be guided by the provisions of RSA 541-A.\n\n(b) To the extent that RSA 356-B is not inconsistent with RSA 541-A, the bureau shall comply with and be guided by the appropriate provisions of RSA 356-B.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Jus 1400) #9783-A, eff 9-11-10, EXPIRED: 9-11-18\n\nNew. #12657, INTERIM, eff 11-1-18, EXPIRED: 4-30-19\n\nNew. #12910, eff 10-24-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/jus1400.html"
